<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-13866] Validate index does not stop after process of control.sh was interrupted</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13866</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Validate index command might to continue in a cluster even after the command is emergency terminated.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For example: we can type CTRL+c in console for terminate an incorrect command invocation, but this command does not be terminated in cluster. In the end of this we have a several processes the result of which does not need anymore.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
